{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_199_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_199","textTraditional":"一、十有八年，春，王三月，曹伯須卒。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_199_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_199","textTraditional":"二、夏，五月，壬午，宋、衞、陳、鄭災。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_199_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_199","textTraditional":"其志，以同日也。其日，亦以同日也。或曰：「人有謂子產曰：『某日有災』，子產曰：『天者神，子惡知之？』」是人也，同日為四國災也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_199_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_199","textTraditional":"三、六月，邾人入鄅。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_199_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_199","textTraditional":"四、秋，葬曹平公。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_199_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_199","textTraditional":"五、冬，許遷於白羽。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}